{"entity":{"id":[{"value":"6"}],"uuid":[{"value":"7941f8f7-f29a-408d-8348-74368c8da2c9"}],"vid":[{"value":"6"}],"langcode":[{"value":"fr"}],"type":[{"target_id":"article_de_blogs_prestige"}],"revision_timestamp":[{"value":"1723816670"}],"revision_uid":[{"target_id":"1"}],"revision_log":[],"status":[{"value":"1"}],"user_id":[{"target_id":"1"}],"name":[{"value":"L\u00e9o et Violette x Wendy Swan"}],"created":[{"value":"1723816670"}],"changed":[{"value":"1723910538"}],"paragraph_revisions":[{"target_id":"61","target_revision_id":"61"},{"target_id":"47","target_revision_id":"47"},{"target_id":"7","target_revision_id":"7"}],"revision_translation_affected":[{"value":"1"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":"1"}],"revision_default":[{"value":"1"}],"metatag":[{"tag":"meta","attributes":{"name":"title","content":"Select Export Entity | Drush Site-Install"}},{"tag":"link","attributes":{"rel":"canonical","href":"http:\/\/shopping-sacs.kksa\/fr\/admin\/export-import-entities\/select-export-storage-entity"}}],"path":[{"alias":"\/leo-et-violette-x-wendy-swan","pid":"49","langcode":"fr"}],"field_commentaires":[{"status":"2","cid":"0","last_comment_timestamp":"1723816944","last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_uid":"1","comment_count":"0"}],"field_description":[{"value":"\u003Cp\u003ELe Dalia est le premier sac cr\u00e9\u00e9 en collaboration avec L\u00e9o et Violette. Il est n\u00e9 de notre rencontre avec Wendy. L\u0027univers de Wendy, minimaliste et \u00e9l\u00e9gant, correspond parfaitement \u00e0 l\u0027esprit L\u00e9o et Violette. Outre la compl\u00e9mentarit\u00e9 de nos univers, notre vision de la maroquinerie est \u00e9galement la m\u00eame.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Ch4\u003ENOTRE VISION\u003C\/h4\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENous avons souhait\u00e9 donner tout son sens au mot \u0022collaborer\u0022 : des premiers dessins \u00e0 la visite de notre atelier \u00e0 Naples, en passant par le choix du fermoir, tout du Dalia a \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9fini ensemble.\u003Cbr\u003EIl est la combinaison parfaite du style minimaliste de Wendy et de l\u0027esth\u00e9tique de L\u00e9o et Violette.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDonner la possibilit\u00e9 \u00e0 Wendy de concevoir son sac id\u00e9al, celui qui correspond autant \u00e0 son style qu\u0027\u00e0 ses besoins quotidiens. Le Dalia est le fruit de plusieurs mois de travail commun entre elle et notre \u00e9quipe de design.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EChaque d\u00e9tail, du choix de la qualit\u00e9 du cuir aux pi\u00e8ces m\u00e9talliques, a \u00e9t\u00e9 soigneusement pens\u00e9.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022\/sites\/default\/files\/inline-images\/leo_et_violette_x_wendy_swan-1.webp\u0022 data-entity-uuid=\u00222cc1e20f-cad3-4b76-a29a-06b33d6d308f\u0022 data-entity-type=\u0022file\u0022 alt=\u0022L\u00e9o et Violette x Wendy Swan\u0022 width=\u00221501\u0022 height=\u00222221\u0022\u003E\u003Cblockquote\u003E\u003Cp\u003EJ\u0027ai d\u00e9couvert L\u00e9o et Violette il y a 3 ans et j\u0027adore voir l\u0027\u00e9volution au fil du temps, l\u0027univers me correspond particuli\u00e8rement. Les sacs ont toujours \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u0027une tr\u00e8s bonne qualit\u00e9, on sent qu\u0027on peut les garder des ann\u00e9es et c\u0027est ce qui m\u0027int\u00e9resse. Le style est intemporel et tr\u00e8s chic \u00e0 la fran\u00e7aise. On ne s\u0027en lasse pas !\u003C\/p\u003E\u003C\/blockquote\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u2013 Wendy Swan\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDans les moindres d\u00e9tails\u003Cbr\u003EComme toujours chez L\u00e9o et Violette, nous misons sur la qualit\u00e9 pour cr\u00e9er des produits intemporels.\u003Cbr\u003EWendy a apport\u00e9 un soin tout particulier aux d\u00e9tails du Dalia. Son design, r\u00e9solument vintage, permet de transporter tous vos essentiels du quotidien.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELe fermoir en m\u00e9tal dor\u00e9 a \u00e9t\u00e9 sp\u00e9cialement d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 pour le sac, tout comme la double bandouli\u00e8re. Les 3 coloris, intemporels et \u00e9l\u00e9gants, ont \u00e9t\u00e9 choisis par Wendy pour s\u0027int\u00e9grer facilement dans un style minimaliste.\u003C\/p\u003E\u003Ch4\u003EFabriqu\u00e9 en Italie\u003C\/h4\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ciframe title=\u0022vimeo-player\u0022 src=\u0022https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/601707715?h=6ef724ab77\u0022 width=\u0022640\u0022 height=\u0022360\u0022 frameborder=\u00220\u0022 allowfullscreen=\u0022\u0022\u003E\u003C\/iframe\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E","format":"full_html"}],"field_image":[{"target_id":"106","alt":"L\u00e9o et Violette x Wendy Swan","title":"","width":"2400","height":"1200"}],"field_tags_blogs":[{"target_id":"1"},{"target_id":"2"}]},"form_sort":[{"name":"status","label":"Publi\u00e9","description":"A boolean indicating whether the Blocks contents is published.","cardinality":1,"type":"boolean_checkbox","weight":-3,"region":"content","settings":{"display_label":true},"third_party_settings":[],"definition_settings":{"on_label":"Activ\u00e9","off_label":"D\u00e9sactiv\u00e9"},"constraints":[]},{"name":"name","label":"Nom","description":"The name of the Blocks contents entity.","cardinality":1,"type":"string_textfield","weight":0,"region":"content","settings":{"size":60,"placeholder":""},"third_party_settings":[],"definition_settings":{"max_length":250,"is_ascii":false,"case_sensitive":false,"text_processing":0},"constraints":{"NotNull":[]}},{"name":"field_image","label":"Image","description":"","cardinality":1,"type":"image_image","weight":1,"region":"content","settings":{"progress_indicator":"throbber","preview_image_style":"thumbnail"},"third_party_settings":[],"definition_settings":{"handler":"default:file","handler_settings":[],"file_directory":"[date:custom:Y]-[date:custom:m]","file_extensions":"png gif jpg jpeg webp","max_filesize":"","max_resolution":"","min_resolution":"","alt_field":true,"alt_field_required":true,"title_field":false,"title_field_required":false,"default_image":{"uuid":"","alt":"","title":"","width":null,"height":null},"target_type":"file","display_field":false,"d